sequenceDiagram
participant App as Mobil App
participant KC as Keycloak
participant BFF as NestJS BFF

    App->>KC: Authorization Code kérés (PKCE)
    KC-->>App: Authorization Code
    App->>KC: Token csere (code + code_verifier)
    KC-->>App: access_token + refresh_token
    App->>App: signIn(tokens) - authStore-ba menti
    App->>BFF: POST /api/profile/me
    BFF-->>App: Profile
    